{"articleNo":"241355","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=241355&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 금오공대(온라인)갤러리-김호민 작가와의 대화","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.08.28","hit":"8771","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img width=\"873\" height=\"704\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"width: 873px; height: 704px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBlHoQTnA7AvA7gMQIIBdmwOYDMBSACgOoAqArgIoCOAzgA7kB0AVvdkA%20\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">학생과에서 진행하는&nbsp;금오공대갤러리의 문화예술강연 프로그램인 '작가와의 대화'가&nbsp; 무관중으로 진행되었으며,&nbsp;강연 영상을 &lt;금오공대(온라인)갤러리&gt;로 공개합니다. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">○<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;김호민 초대전 작가와의 대화 &lt; 1편. 김호민 작가와 함께하는 전시투어1 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&gt;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt; 2편. 김호민 작가와 함께하는 전시투어2 <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(140, 140, 140);\">총 3편으로 구성됩니다.&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\">&nbsp;(강연일 : 2020. 8. 25.(화)14:30~&nbsp;/ 영상 촬영 및 편집 : 금오공대교육방송국(KOBS))</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\">○</font><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;재학생의 경우, 수강완료(총 3차시의 70%이상 수강)시 K-CDP점수 1점이 부여됩니다. </span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">○ 관람 방법 : 금오공대 강의지원시스템 - &lt;공개강의(OCW)&gt; - &lt;금오공대(온라인)갤러리&gt; 를 통해 관람 가능</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">교직원은 원스톱 아이디</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">/</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">패스워드로 로그인 가능합니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">&nbsp;</span><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http:/